   \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial y} & \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial y} & \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial z} \\
   \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial z} & \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial z} & \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial z}
   \end{vmatrix}
   \]
   Here, the Jacobian matrix is:
   \[
   \begin{bmatrix}
   \epsilon_x & \frac{\gamma_{xy}}{2} & 0 \\
   \frac{\gamma_{xy}}{2} & \epsilon_y & 0 \\
   0 & 0 & 0
   \end{bmatrix}
   \]

