   \[
   \Delta H_{\text{gas}} = \Delta H_{\text{air}} = (1 \text{ g} \times 1.005 \text{ kg/g} \times 1.005 \times 10^{-3} \text{ kg/kg} \times 1 \times 10^3 \times \text{kg/g} \times 1100 \times 10^{-1} \times \text{kg/K} \times 550 \times 10^{-1} \times \text{kg/K}) = 1.005 \times 1100 \times 550 \times 10^{-1} \times 10^{-1} = 55575 \text{ J}
